# @hub-lanes

# ── DAILY-DIGEST LANE (BH-3688) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every 15 minutes; from DAILY_DIGEST_SEND_HOUR_UTC (default 07Z) it reads
# GET /api/metrics/daily-digest for yesterday (UTC), renders it, and sends ONE
# triaged fleet_alert beat per day. The jobs ledger row daily_digest/<day> plus
# state/daily-digest/sent-<day> dedupe it, so the other ticks of the day do
# nothing. It never calls Telegram itself. One summary line per tick that does
# work in logs/daily-digest.log; flock -n dedupes. Off: the daily-digest-off
# switch, DAILY_DIGEST_ENABLED=0, flags/lane-off-daily-digest, or
# bin/harness-ctl.sh off daily-digest.
*/15 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/daily-digest.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
